+## Staff Sign-in
+
+Session-based accounts (no social login or 2FA yet). Screens are pt-BR by default, with English as fallback.
+
+- E-mail is stored lowercase and unique; the password needs at least 8 characters with letters (both cases) and numbers.
+- Sign-in fails with the same message for unknown e-mails and wrong passwords. After 5 failed attempts for an e-mail + IP pair, sign-in is locked until those attempts age out of the 60-second limiter window.
+- Registration is limited to 5 attempts per IP. New accounts start unverified and must confirm their e-mail before reaching `/home`.
+- Forgot-password answers the same way whether or not the e-mail is registered, and accepts 6 requests per minute.
+- A password reset rotates the remember token, so "remember me" cookies issued before the reset stop working.
+
